{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_955.unity3d","item_key":"commands[3].text","source_sha256":"5a57aba35549c46fc5f8339adc0c657e3e835c88d29449b929cd915151df876f","ja":"観賞会の行方","zh":"观赏会的走向","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_955.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"f79abe6a3d2de1326a716669eaf5ba472bdbe0a921dabb4f46eba3b3492813cb","ja":"ねえみんな、今度レッスンしてくれる\nダンサーさんのVTR、どうだった？","zh":"大家，下次来给我们上课的\n舞蹈老师的录像，怎么样？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_955.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"4c0238b93bc3c80a830b7fdbe7d4dad026274ac221df3c655d0dacc7c776849d","ja":"……すごかったです。歌もないのに、\n踊りだけでいろんなことを表現していて……。","zh":"……好厉害。明明没有歌声，\n只用舞蹈就表达了各种各样的东西……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_955.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"fa8d00172926b8b5d6802c10e8495788e2c9eccea3a450b1c7734265a32167ec","ja":"わたし、なんだか感動して\n涙が出ちゃいそうになりました！","zh":"我不知怎么的感动了，\n眼泪都快流出来了！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_955.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"60eee7d1429e01edee480132869d99cda49ace42c2c513e38c38fdf88bb04382","ja":"せりりん、息止めて観てたもんね。ダンサーさんの\n踊りに込める想い、伝わってよかった～♪","zh":"せりりん，你一直屏住呼吸看着呢。舞者们寄托在舞蹈中的心意能传达给你，真是太好了～♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_955.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"0b73b636f418a29ad90441b21c9bc7f9a7a204ed07b0be172d9c72d55fbb51a5","ja":"はい……なんていうか、目が離せなくって……\nすっごく力強いなって思いましたっ！","zh":"是的……怎么说呢，让人移不开视线……\n我觉得非常有力量！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_955.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"7157ae664cfba3393f7db59a082cd12bede4adf59827b53dd124e757dae3b46e","ja":"わかるわかる！　めちゃくちゃパワー感じるよね！\nみんなで見れて良かったよ～♪","zh":"我懂我懂！能感觉到超强的力量呢！\n能和大家一起看到真是太好了～♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_955.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"57554335b64a8de27cff23c4d5d99a7d8ebf589181d29f5d6955311ab17d6226","ja":"こんなにすごい方の、レッスンを受けるなんて……。\nあの、ロコさんとあずささんはどう思いました？","zh":"能接受这么厉害的人的指导……  \n那个，ROCO先生和梓小姐觉得怎么样？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_955.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"35d6b2fc77f08a119eb79deab1fd03045c7c83291c4709cd94a4f860238e7f4e","ja":"感動しました……。内なるパッションを\nダイナミックに表現していて……。","zh":"感动了……。将内心的热情\n动感十足地表现了出来……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_955.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"1b45cee6514d5690d5bbb78bd6c911708d74bcb063166bba9c3955a391469d90","ja":"私も圧倒されちゃったわ。次にどんな\n振り付けがくるのか、まったく予想できなくて。","zh":"我也被震撼到了。完全无法预料\n接下来会是什么样的舞蹈动作。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_955.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"657dbc70fd7c1ddebaec9ca434d69ffd8baf6adf6548e7cba5576946d07d238c","ja":"はい。とてつもないパフォーマンスでとりこに\nなりました。うぅ……プレッシャーを感じます……。","zh":"是的。我被那惊人的表演迷住了。\n呜呜……感觉到了压力……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_955.unity3d","item_key":"commands[28].text","source_sha256":"5d1e41a152c355f5e765517386c8a0952f5ccddf0288592723e1db56ecffffa4","ja":"ロコさんもですか？","zh":"ROCO先生也是吗？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_955.unity3d","item_key":"commands[29].text","source_sha256":"2bdea3f46c1512a9ba6a1029090fc1e794354455150d7865d8160e370da4b9f7","ja":"わたしも、この方のダンスを好きになればなるほど、\n変なところを見せられないって感じてしまって……。","zh":"我也一样，越是喜欢上这位的舞蹈，\n就越觉得不能让他看到自己奇怪的地方……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_955.unity3d","item_key":"commands[30].text","source_sha256":"3082601d31a5f2af1b1b76fc898b19cd3e733f5477e66143d5b1df00f246b8e8","ja":"あれっ！？　おかしいな～……みんなで\nファンになれば解決！って思ってたんだけど……。","zh":"咦！？　好奇怪啊～……我还以为只要大家\n都成为粉丝就能解决呢……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_955.unity3d","item_key":"commands[31].text","source_sha256":"6f93f2b917a2f3f53c3c61c0652f66c3ebf91e8687e3bb2d66bae7b5732be8a4","ja":"そうだったんですか……？\nごめんなさい。せっかく考えてくれたのに。","zh":"原来是这样啊……？\n对不起。明明是你特意为我考虑的。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_955.unity3d","item_key":"commands[32].text","source_sha256":"3ab09fe2d603a070f015e1af50eeca5ee477f6106cc0c52e7d7f817f64d50947","ja":"ううん、大丈夫だよ！　それじゃあ、他になにか、\n特別レッスンの前にできることないかな……？","zh":"没事的！那么，还有什么别的，\n能在特别课程之前做的吗……？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_955.unity3d","item_key":"commands[33].text","source_sha256":"577a50dd9666f25650e22cb528e070341ed4a2c8e73fba2e475da24b7660e8c4","ja":"うーん、うーん……。","zh":"嗯……嗯……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_955.unity3d","item_key":"commands[35].text","source_sha256":"aa0fa4e6c1f2e410c5ecc91bce9d32de6c381746c7ca73729c1ef53e70a2d257","ja":"……あ、そうだ！\nじゃあ次は、あれでいこう！","zh":"……啊，对了！\n那接下来就用那个吧！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_955.unity3d","item_key":"commands[36].text","source_sha256":"2c14133dc161d7295b921f191137bf95e438023564eb7cbb04041315c93bdbf4","ja":"えっ？　あれって、なんですか……？","zh":"咦？那是什么……？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
